; routine's LAST statement. The effect-free gate judged non-last statements
; only -- the last may be an implicit return -- so `print sb.to_string()`
; closing a procedure emitted neither call at rc 0 while the same line one
; statement earlier was refused (2026-09-29, a probe for the json package
; printed nothing). An operator call with no name is never a value: it is
; judged in every position.
